native/whale.svg — DeepSeek Harness "FishLogo"
================================================================================

The fish silhouette in native/whale.svg is reproduced from the FishLogo asset of
DeepSeek Harness (packages/client/ui-primitives/src/FishLogo.tsx). Its SVG path
data is byte-for-byte identical to the upstream FISH_LOGO_PATH constant, and its
viewBox matches FISH_LOGO_VIEWBOX (23.16 x 17.04). dsh-notify uses it unmodified
as a macOS template image for its menu bar status item.

